<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RBM mode's gear of Commander Battle's Vlandian troop classes (cb_mpclassdivisions_vlandia.xml), read by
  CommanderBattle/RbmLoadouts.cs (its header has the format). Light mode keeps the classes' mp_ gear and never reads
  this file. Singleplayer items only, as RBM retunes them (RBM.Multiplayer loads SandBoxCore's items and RBM's item
  files in multiplayer): no mp_ items, no looter or nord items.
  - One Class per MPHeroClass id, the general's class included. Hero: the commander's gear. Troop: the bots' rosters;
    a bot draws every slot from a random roster, so each slot holds the same kind of item in every roster and the
    rosters only vary the looks (armour and helmets of one tier). Setup N: the class's N-th weapon setup perk, slot
    for slot as its AlternativeEquipmentOnSpawn effects (no id empties the slot).
  - Slots as the mp_ characters: Item0 main weapon, Item1 shield (or bolts), Item2 sidearm, Item3 the crossbowmen's
    pavise. Cape holds RBM's shoulder pieces (the levies' hoods). Mounted classes have a horse and a harness in the
    hero and in every roster; foot classes none.
  - Gear tiers: light = levy (aketons and padded coats, a real helmet); medium = men-at-arms and mounted sergeants
    (mail, tabards over mail); heavy = dismounted knights and knights (brigandines over mail, full helms, the best
    weapons).
  - Vlandian doctrine: the heaviest knights, armoured pike and polearm infantry, crossbows with pavises. No throwing
    weapons, no bows, no horse archers. Sidearm rule (README): spears, pikes and lances keep the sword; maces,
    swords and the swung two-handers (bill, voulge) clear it; crossbowmen keep theirs.
  - Shields and pavises: the plain ids, not RBM's _shoulder copies its troops carry (same stats, but their holsters,
    the deployable pavise's included, come from RBM's holster loader, which multiplayer doesn't run).
  - The arbalest setups use crossbow_g (300 pound, RBM's sharpshooter), as the mp_ classes share mp_heavier_crossbow.
  Seeded from RBM's troop overhaul (RBMCombat_unit_overhaul.xml):
    levy spearman          vlandian_footman (pike: vlandian_recruit's simple pike)
    man-at-arms            vlandian_infantry, vlandian_swordsman (long sword; pike: fine_pike_t4, a plain head, not RBM's military fork), vlandian_billman (bill)
    dismounted knight      vlandian_sergeant, vlandian_pikeman (pike, sword), vlandian_voulgier (voulge)
    levy crossbowman       vlandian_levy_crossbowman (helmets: vlandian_crossbowman's, the levy wears only coifs)
    crossbowman-at-arms    vlandian_sharpshooter, vlandian_hardened_crossbowman (crossbow, bolts, sword)
    light horseman         vlandian_squire (light lance: vlandian_gallant)
    mounted sergeant       vlandian_light_cavalry (RBM's Vlandian Medium Cavalry; lance: vlandian_knight)
    knight                 vlandian_champion
    lord, household knight vlandian_banner_knight, the lord with the crowned plate helmet
-->
